    {
      "id": "05-proteins",
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "proteins",
      "text": "21.6 grams of protein. Essential amino acids score is 9 out of 9, making the protein useful for repair and maintenance. Bioavailability is 72%, helping more of that protein count, but it is the smaller helper in this section. For legumes, protein support is a big part of what makes them useful.",
