    {
      "id": "07-minerals",
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "minerals",
      "text": "Magnesium is 30% daily value, adding useful mineral support. Potassium is 32% daily value, useful for fluid balance. For legumes, minerals matter because they are one of the main ways this category adds value.",
